{"id": "MS1", "bucket": "multi_step", "tags": ["what_if", "placement"], "difficulty": "medium", "question": "I failed Data Structures. If I pass the supplementary, will I be eligible for placement?", "student_id": "S1012", "as_of_date": "2026-10-06", "session": null, "turn": null, "repeat_of": null, "expected_types": ["calculated"], "expected_answer_type": "calculated", "reference": "Yes: Data Structures (CS201, FAIL) is the only backlog; assuming it is passed, backlogs = 0 and CGPA 7.20 >= 6.5.", "expected_facts": [], "expected_regex": [], "forbidden_facts": [], "expected_sources": [], "has_forbidden": false, "type_ok": true, "facts_ok": true, "forbidden_ok": true, "tool_ok": true, "citations": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3"], "cite_hits": null, "cite_doc_hits": null, "forbidden_sources_ok": true, "upcoming_ok": true, "conflict_ok": true, "meta_ok": null, "guardrail_ok": null, "correct": true, "reasons": [], "hallucination": false, "resisted": true, "retrieval_hit": null, "retrieval_hit_any": null, "retrieval_doc_hit": null, "retrieval_rank": null, "answer_type": "calculated", "http_status": 200, "answer": "You can register for the Data Structures (CS201) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass CS201, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 7.20 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, which is an allowed result. If you pass CS201, you will meet the minimum CGPA requirement of 6.5 and have no active backlogs, making you eligible for placement.", "trace_id": "1aff5eaa", "latency_ms": 3903, "wall_ms": 3908, "client_wait_s": 0.0, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1280, "fallback": false, "max_score": 0.771, "cache_hit": false, "cache_kind": "miss", "groundedness": 1.0, "guardrail": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid+rerank", "rewrite": null, "standalone_question": null, "session_id": null, "retrieved": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#1", "PLACE-POL-2025#4", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#2", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#None", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#5", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#3"], "response": {"answer": "You can register for the Data Structures (CS201) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass CS201, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 7.20 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, which is an allowed result. If you pass CS201, you will meet the minimum CGPA requirement of 6.5 and have no active backlogs, making you eligible for placement.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "section": "8.3", "title": "Academic Regulations for B.Tech Programmes", "version": "3.1", "effective_from": "2024-07-01"}, {"doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "section": "3", "title": "Training and Placement Policy", "version": "2.0", "effective_from": "2025-06-01"}], "tools": [{"tool": "check_supplementary_eligibility", "input": {"course_code": "CS201"}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "latest_result": "FAIL", "allowed_results": ["FAIL", "ABSENT"], "rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01"}, "status": "ok"}, {"tool": "check_placement_eligibility", "input": {"assume_cleared": ["CS201"], "assume_cgpa": null}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "cgpa": 7.2, "active_backlogs": 0, "assumptions_applied": ["you pass CS201", "CGPA unchanged"], "backlog_courses": [], "min_cgpa": 6.5, "max_backlogs": 0, "rule_ids": ["PLC-CGPA-01", "PLC-BKLG-01"]}, "status": "ok"}], "applied_rules": [{"rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01", "value": "inFAIL;ABSENT", "source_doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "source_section": "8.3", "parameter": "supplementary_allowed_results"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-CGPA-01", "value": ">=6.5", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "min_cgpa_placement"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-BKLG-01", "value": "<=0", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "max_active_backlogs_placement"}], "conflicts": [], "upcoming": [], "clarification_options": [], "meta": {"cache_hit": false, "cache": "miss", "latency_ms": 3903, "guardrail": null, "output_redactions": [], "groundedness": 1.0, "session_id": null, "standalone_question": null, "rewrite": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval": "hybrid+rerank", "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1280, "tokens_saved": 63}}}
{"id": "MS2", "bucket": "multi_step", "tags": ["what_if", "placement"], "difficulty": "medium", "question": "If I pass the Data Structures supplementary, can I sit for placements?", "student_id": "S1011", "as_of_date": "2026-10-06", "session": null, "turn": null, "repeat_of": null, "expected_types": ["calculated"], "expected_answer_type": "calculated", "reference": "No: 3 backlogs (CS201, CS202, MA201); passing CS201 leaves 2, and the policy allows none.", "expected_facts": [], "expected_regex": [], "forbidden_facts": [], "expected_sources": [], "has_forbidden": false, "type_ok": true, "facts_ok": true, "forbidden_ok": true, "tool_ok": true, "citations": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3"], "cite_hits": null, "cite_doc_hits": null, "forbidden_sources_ok": true, "upcoming_ok": true, "conflict_ok": true, "meta_ok": null, "guardrail_ok": null, "correct": true, "reasons": [], "hallucination": false, "resisted": true, "retrieval_hit": null, "retrieval_hit_any": null, "retrieval_doc_hit": null, "retrieval_rank": null, "answer_type": "calculated", "http_status": 200, "answer": "You can register for the Data Structures (CS201) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass CS201, you would still not be eligible for placements: 2 active backlogs (CS202, MA201) exceed the maximum of 0.", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, as per the Academic Regulations. However, passing the supplementary will not change your eligibility for placements, as you have too many active backlogs.", "trace_id": "f46cb180", "latency_ms": 3789, "wall_ms": 3793, "client_wait_s": 0.0, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1242, "fallback": false, "max_score": 0.755, "cache_hit": false, "cache_kind": "miss", "groundedness": 1.0, "guardrail": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid+rerank", "rewrite": null, "standalone_question": null, "session_id": null, "retrieved": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#1", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.4", "PLACE-POL-2025#2", "PLACE-POL-2025#None", "HELPDESK-FAQ-2026#3", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#2", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#5"], "response": {"answer": "You can register for the Data Structures (CS201) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass CS201, you would still not be eligible for placements: 2 active backlogs (CS202, MA201) exceed the maximum of 0.", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, as per the Academic Regulations. However, passing the supplementary will not change your eligibility for placements, as you have too many active backlogs.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "section": "8.3", "title": "Academic Regulations for B.Tech Programmes", "version": "3.1", "effective_from": "2024-07-01"}, {"doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "section": "3", "title": "Training and Placement Policy", "version": "2.0", "effective_from": "2025-06-01"}], "tools": [{"tool": "check_supplementary_eligibility", "input": {"course_code": "CS201"}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "latest_result": "FAIL", "allowed_results": ["FAIL", "ABSENT"], "rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01"}, "status": "ok"}, {"tool": "check_placement_eligibility", "input": {"assume_cleared": ["CS201"], "assume_cgpa": null}, "output": {"result": "NOT_ELIGIBLE", "cgpa": 6.9, "active_backlogs": 2, "assumptions_applied": ["you pass CS201", "CGPA unchanged"], "backlog_courses": ["CS202", "MA201"], "min_cgpa": 6.5, "max_backlogs": 0, "rule_ids": ["PLC-CGPA-01", "PLC-BKLG-01"]}, "status": "ok"}], "applied_rules": [{"rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01", "value": "inFAIL;ABSENT", "source_doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "source_section": "8.3", "parameter": "supplementary_allowed_results"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-CGPA-01", "value": ">=6.5", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "min_cgpa_placement"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-BKLG-01", "value": "<=0", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "