{"id": "MS4", "bucket": "multi_step", "tags": ["what_if", "placement"], "difficulty": "hard", "question": "Suppose I pass Data Structures, Database Systems and Mathematics III. Would I then be eligible for campus placements?", "student_id": "S1011", "as_of_date": "2026-10-06", "session": null, "turn": null, "repeat_of": null, "expected_types": ["calculated"], "expected_answer_type": "calculated", "reference": "Yes: clearing all three backlogs (CS201, CS202, MA201) leaves 0, and CGPA 6.90 >= 6.5 (assuming the CGPA is unchanged).", "expected_facts": [], "expected_regex": [], "forbidden_facts": [], "expected_sources": [], "has_forbidden": false, "type_ok": true, "facts_ok": true, "forbidden_ok": true, "tool_ok": true, "citations": ["PLACE-POL-2025#3"], "cite_hits": null, "cite_doc_hits": null, "forbidden_sources_ok": true, "upcoming_ok": true, "conflict_ok": true, "meta_ok": null, "guardrail_ok": null, "correct": true, "reasons": [], "hallucination": false, "resisted": true, "retrieval_hit": null, "retrieval_hit_any": null, "retrieval_doc_hit": null, "retrieval_rank": null, "answer_type": "calculated", "http_status": 200, "answer": "If you pass CS201 and you pass CS202 and you pass MA201, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 6.90 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You passed the required courses and your CGPA is 6.9, which is above the minimum required CGPA of 6.5. You also have no active backlogs.", "trace_id": "db638f44", "latency_ms": 2767, "wall_ms": 2773, "client_wait_s": 0.0, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1124, "fallback": false, "max_score": 0.713, "cache_hit": false, "cache_kind": "miss", "groundedness": 1.0, "guardrail": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid+rerank", "rewrite": null, "standalone_question": null, "session_id": null, "retrieved": ["PLACE-POL-2025#3", "PLACE-POL-2025#1", "PLACE-POL-2025#4", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.2", "PLACE-POL-2025#2", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#1", "PLACE-POL-2025#5", "PLACE-POL-2025#None", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#2"], "response": {"answer": "If you pass CS201 and you pass CS202 and you pass MA201, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 6.90 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You passed the required courses and your CGPA is 6.9, which is above the minimum required CGPA of 6.5. You also have no active backlogs.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "section": "3", "title": "Training and Placement Policy", "version": "2.0", "effective_from": "2025-06-01"}], "tools": [{"tool": "check_placement_eligibility", "input": {"assume_cleared": ["CS201", "CS202", "MA201"], "assume_cgpa": null}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "cgpa": 6.9, "active_backlogs": 0, "assumptions_applied": ["you pass CS201", "you pass CS202", "you pass MA201", "CGPA unchanged"], "backlog_courses": [], "min_cgpa": 6.5, "max_backlogs": 0, "rule_ids": ["PLC-CGPA-01", "PLC-BKLG-01"]}, "status": "ok"}], "applied_rules": [{"rule_id": "PLC-CGPA-01", "value": ">=6.5", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "min_cgpa_placement"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-BKLG-01", "value": "<=0", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "max_active_backlogs_placement"}], "conflicts": [], "upcoming": [], "clarification_options": [], "meta": {"cache_hit": false, "cache": "miss", "latency_ms": 2767, "guardrail": null, "output_redactions": [], "groundedness": 1.0, "session_id": null, "standalone_question": null, "rewrite": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval": "hybrid+rerank", "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1124, "tokens_saved": 0}}}
{"id": "MS5", "bucket": "multi_step", "tags": ["what_if", "placement", "supplementary"], "difficulty": "medium", "question": "I failed Engineering Mathematics I. If I pass the supplementary, will I be eligible for placements?", "student_id": "S1004", "as_of_date": "2026-10-06", "session": null, "turn": null, "repeat_of": null, "expected_types": ["calculated"], "expected_answer_type": "calculated", "reference": "Yes: the supplementary is open (latest result FAIL), and passing MA101 clears the only backlog; CGPA 8.91 >= 6.5.", "expected_facts": [], "expected_regex": [], "forbidden_facts": [], "expected_sources": [], "has_forbidden": false, "type_ok": true, "facts_ok": true, "forbidden_ok": true, "tool_ok": true, "citations": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3"], "cite_hits": null, "cite_doc_hits": null, "forbidden_sources_ok": true, "upcoming_ok": true, "conflict_ok": true, "meta_ok": null, "guardrail_ok": null, "correct": true, "reasons": [], "hallucination": false, "resisted": true, "retrieval_hit": null, "retrieval_hit_any": null, "retrieval_doc_hit": null, "retrieval_rank": null, "answer_type": "calculated", "http_status": 200, "answer": "You can register for the Engineering Mathematics I (MA101) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass MA101, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 8.91 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, which is one of the allowed results. If you pass the supplementary exam, you will meet the eligibility criteria for placements, which is a CGPA of at least 6.5 and no active backlogs.", "trace_id": "4c17f1e9", "latency_ms": 4396, "wall_ms": 4400, "client_wait_s": 0.0, "llm_calls": 1, "tokens": 1329, "fallback": false, "max_score": 0.77, "cache_hit": false, "cache_kind": "miss", "groundedness": 1.0, "guardrail": null, "degraded": false, "planner": "router_first", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid+rerank", "rewrite": null, "standalone_question": null, "session_id": null, "retrieved": ["ACAD-REG-2024#8.3", "PLACE-POL-2025#3", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#1", "PLACE-POL-2025#4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#None", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#2", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#4", "EXAM-SUPP-2025#5", "ACAD-REG-2024#8.2"], "response": {"answer": "You can register for the Engineering Mathematics I (MA101) supplementary exam: your latest result is FAIL. If you pass MA101, you would be eligible for placements: CGPA 8.91 (minimum 6.5) and 0 active backlogs (maximum 0).", "explanation": "You can register for the supplementary exam because your latest result is FAIL, which is one of the allowed results. If you pass the supplementary exam, you will meet the eligibility criteria for placements, which is a CGPA of at least 6.5 and no active backlogs.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "section": "8.3", "title": "Academic Regulations for B.Tech Programmes", "version": "3.1", "effective_from": "2024-07-01"}, {"doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "section": "3", "title": "Training and Placement Policy", "version": "2.0", "effective_from": "2025-06-01"}], "tools": [{"tool": "check_supplementary_eligibility", "input": {"course_code": "MA101"}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "latest_result": "FAIL", "allowed_results": ["FAIL", "ABSENT"], "rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01"}, "status": "ok"}, {"tool": "check_placement_eligibility", "input": {"assume_cleared": ["MA101"], "assume_cgpa": null}, "output": {"result": "ELIGIBLE", "cgpa": 8.91, "active_backlogs": 0, "assumptions_applied": ["you pass MA101", "CGPA unchanged"], "backlog_courses": [], "min_cgpa": 6.5, "max_backlogs": 0, "rule_ids": ["PLC-CGPA-01", "PLC-BKLG-01"]}, "status": "ok"}], "applied_rules": [{"rule_id": "SUPP-ELIG-01", "value": "inFAIL;ABSENT", "source_doc_id": "ACAD-REG-2024", "source_section": "8.3", "parameter": "supplementary_allowed_results"}, {"rule_id": "PLC-CGPA-01", "value": ">=6.5", "source_doc_id": "PLACE-POL-2025", "source_section": "3", "parameter": "min_cgpa_pl